# Mirrored+patched upstream Sky examples — materialised at sweep time by
# scripts/lib/sky_mirror.sh (IPE_SWEEP_MIRROR_SKY=1). Regenerated each run, never
# vendored; only the rename map + README + manifest under examples/sky/ are source.
/examples/sky/[0-9]*/
/examples/sky/simple/
/examples/sky/test_pkg/
# Default SQLite DB written by `Db.connect ()` when an emitted binary is run
# by the E2E test harness in the crate/repo cwd — a run artifact, never source.
sky.db
sky.db-shm
sky.db-wal

# Playwright browser-scenario stack deps (scripts/equivalence-checks/{package.json,
